  message: "Fixed in PR 793c40242. Verified on docspell (http4s now detected) and lila (play + akka-http now detected). Root cause: _detect_scala_frameworks only scanned build.sbt, missing SBT meta-build convention where dep coordinates live in project/Dependencies.scala and plugins in project/plugins.sbt. Fix expands detector to include project/*.scala + project/*.sbt. Flask-AppBuilder (Python, separate code path) not yet verified — tracked in WI-vabiv follow-up."  # 27fc
